msgid "Tables and plotting"
msgstr "表格与绘图"

msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgid "Variables can be printed in Table form using the command"
msgstr "变量可以通过命令以表格形式打印"

msgid ""
"The values of each variable are printed in one column, so all variables used"
" must be defined for the same range, and corresponding elements should "
"belong together. For example, if in a calculation one has stored ``R(i), "
"THETA(i), ECI(i)`` for each geometry *i*, one can print these data simply "
"using"
msgstr ""
"每个变量的值打印在一列中，因此所有使用的变量必须定义在相同的范围内，并且对应的元素应属于同一组。例如，如果在计算中为每个几何结构 *i* 存储了 "
"``R(i), THETA(i), ECI(i)``\\ ，则可以使用以下命令简单地打印这些数据"

msgid "``TABLE, R, THETA, ECI``"
msgstr "``TABLE, R, THETA, ECI``"

msgid ""
"By default, the number of rows equals the number of elements of the first "
"variable. This can be changed, however, using the ``RANGE`` subcommand."
msgstr "默认情况下，行数等于第一个变量的元素数量。但是，这可以通过使用 ``RANGE`` 子命令来更改。"

msgid ""
"The first ten columns of a table may contain string variables. For instance,"
msgstr "表格的前十列可以包含字符串变量。例如，"

msgid ""
"prints a table with the ``SCF``, ``CCSD``, and ``QCI`` results in the first,"
" second, and third row, respectively. For other use of string variables and "
"tables see the examples in `Tables <introductory_examples.html#tables>`__ "
"and `Macro definitions using string variables <variables.html#macro-"
"definitions-using-string-variables>`__."
msgstr ""
"分别在第一、第二和第三行打印包含 ``SCF``\\ 、\\ ``CCSD`` 和 ``QCI`` 结果的表格。关于字符串变量和表格的其他用法，请参阅 "
"`表格 <introductory_examples.html#tables>`__ 和 `使用字符串变量的宏定义 "
"<variables.html#macrodefinitionsusingstringvariables>`__ 中的示例。"

msgid ""
"``TYPE`` Specify a data format for the table. The default is ``TEXT`` which "
"gives a plain text file. Other possibilities are ``CSV`` (comma-separated "
"fields suitable for a spreadsheet), ``LATEX`` (a LaTeX ``table`` "
"environment), ``MATHEMATICA`` (Mathematica code that assigns the table to an"
" array), ``MATLAB`` (Matlab code that assigns the table to an array), "
"``MAPLE`` (Maple code that assigns the table to an array), ``HTML`` (an HTML"
" construction), ``PYTHON`` (a Python script that contains the data and "
"generates a 2-dimensional plot using `matplotlib "
"<http://matplotlib.org>`__), and ``XML`` (an XML document containing a tree "
"representing the table. The actual format is `XHTML "
"<http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml>`__)."
msgstr ""
"``TYPE`` 指定表格的数据格式。默认为 ``TEXT``\\ ，生成纯文本文件。其他可能性包括 ``CSV``\\ "
"（适用于电子表格的逗号分隔字段）、\\ ``LATEX``\\ （LaTeX 的 ``table`` 环境）、\\ ``MATHEMATICA``\\ "
"（将表格赋值给数组的 Mathematica 代码）、\\ ``MATLAB``\\ （将表格赋值给数组的 Matlab 代码）、\\ "
"``MAPLE``\\ （将表格赋值给数组的 Maple 代码）、\\ ``HTML``\\ （HTML 结构）、\\ ``PYTHON``\\ "
"（包含数据并使用 `matplotlib <http://matplotlib.org>`__ 生成二维图的 Python 脚本）以及 "
"``XML``\\ （包含表示表格的树的 XML 文档。实际格式为 `XHTML <http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml>`__\\"
" ）。"

msgid ""
"``NOPUNCH`` Don’t write data to the punch file (data are written by "
"default)."
msgstr "``NOPUNCH`` 不将数据写入穿孔文件（默认情况下数据会被写入）。"

msgid ""
"For the Python data format, the output is a complete Python module "
"containing the following."
msgstr "对于 Python 数据格式，输出是一个完整的 Python 模块，包含以下内容。"

msgid "``molpro_table`` - a dictionary containing the title and columns"
msgstr "``molpro_table`` - 一个包含标题和列的字典"

msgid ""
"``plot_molpro_table()`` - a function that takes table data and plots the "
"2nd, 3rd,... columns against the first."
msgstr "``plot_molpro_table()`` - 一个接收表格数据并绘制第二、第三、……列相对于第一列的函数。"

msgid ""
"``latex_molpro_table()`` - a function that produces a Latex table "
"environment, optionally transposing the data."
msgstr "``latex_molpro_table()`` - 一个生成 Latex 表格环境的函数，可选择转置数据。"

msgid "A main program that runs ``plot_molpro_table()`` with default options"
msgstr "一个使用默认选项运行 ``plot_molpro_table()`` 的主程序"

msgid ""
"If the output file is modified after running Molpro, a subsequent run of "
"Molpro will replace the data, but leave the code modifications intact."
msgstr "如果在运行 Molpro 后修改了输出文件，后续的 Molpro 运行将替换数据，但会保持代码修改不变。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "followed by, in Python,"
msgstr "随后，在 Python 中，"

msgid ""
"The Python environment should include the ``matplotlib``, ``scipy`` and "
"``numpy`` packages."
msgstr "Python 环境应包含 ``matplotlib``\\ 、\\ ``scipy`` 和 ``numpy`` 包。"

msgid "Plotting"
msgstr "绘图"

msgid ""
"Construct input for a plotting program using the table as data. ``PLOT`` is "
"a subcommand of ``TABLE`` and must follow ``TABLE`` or any of its valid "
"subcommands given in the previous section. More than one ``PLOT`` command "
"can be included within a single ``TABLE``, and each invocation generates a "
"new plot. However, ``PLOT`` must appear after all other ``TABLE`` "
"subcommands."
msgstr ""
"使用表格作为数据，为绘图程序构造输入。\\ ``PLOT`` 是 ``TABLE`` 的一个子命令，必须跟在 ``TABLE`` "
"或其前一节中给出的任何有效子命令之后。单个 ``TABLE`` 中可以包含多个 ``PLOT`` 命令，每次调用都会生成一个新图。但是，\\ "
"``PLOT`` 必须出现在所有其他 ``TABLE`` 子命令之后。"

msgid ""
"*col1*, *col2*,\\ :math:`\\dots` are the names of the table columns to be "
"plotted. These must be an exact subset of those given on the ``TABLE`` "
"command. The first column is taken as abscissa, and the values of the "
"remainder will be plotted against it. If no columns are specified, then the "
"entire table is plotted; if a single column is specified, it will be used as"
" abscissa, and all other columns in the table will be plotted as ordinate. "
"*options* can be chosen from the following."
msgstr ""
"*col1*\\ 、\\ *col2*\\ 、\\ :math:`\\dots` 是要绘制的表格列的名称。这些必须是 ``TABLE`` "
"命令中给出的列的确切子集。第一列被视为横坐标，其余列的值将相对于它绘制。如果未指定任何列，则绘制整个表格；如果指定了单个列，它将被用作横坐标，表格中的所有其他列将作为纵坐标绘制。\\"
" *options* 可以从以下选项中选择。"

msgid ""
"``INTERACTIVE`` By default, the plot is not shown on the screen but all plot"
" data are saved in the given file. The plotting program can be started "
"interactively by giving the ``INTERACTIVE`` option."
msgstr ""
"``INTERACTIVE`` 默认情况下，绘图不会显示在屏幕上，但所有绘图数据都会保存在给定的文件中。通过给出 ``INTERACTIVE`` "
"选项，可以以交互方式启动绘图程序。"

msgid ""
"``BACKGROUND=TRANSPARENT`` The background of the plot is made transparent "
"(currently implemented only for ``TYPE=svg``)."
msgstr "``BACKGROUND=TRANSPARENT`` 使绘图背景透明（目前仅针对 ``TYPE=svg`` 实现）。"

msgid "``NOSPLINE`` Prevents spline interpolation of data points"
msgstr "``NOSPLINE`` 阻止数据点的样条插值"

msgid ""
"The following additional directives can be given *before* the ``PLOT`` "
"directive:"
msgstr "以下附加指令可以在 ``PLOT`` 指令\\ *之前*\\ 给出："

msgid "Diatomic potential curve analysis"
msgstr "双原子势能曲线分析"

msgid ""
"For the case that a table contains one or more potential energy functions "
"for a diatomic molecule, with the first column containing bond lengths in "
"Bohr or Ångstrom, it is possible to calculate spectroscopic constants using"
msgstr "对于表格包含一个或多个双原子分子的势能函数，且第一列包含以玻尔或埃为单位的键长的情况，可以使用以下方法计算光谱常数："

msgid ""
"The data are fitted to a polynomial of degree :math:`n` (default is number "
"of points minus 1, ie interpolation), and spectroscopic constants calculated"
" using reduced mass :math:`m` expressed in u. Note that it is possible to "
"constrain which bond lengths are used through the use of the ``RANGE`` "
"subcommand."
msgstr ""
"数据将拟合到一个 :math:`n` 次多项式（默认值为点数减 1，即插值），并使用以 u 表示的约化质量 :math:`m` "
"计算光谱常数。请注意，可以通过使用 ``RANGE`` 子命令来限制使用哪些键长。"

msgid ""
"D\\ :math:`_{\\rm e}` and D\\ :math:`_0` are computed from the energy at the"
" fitted minimum distance, and the energy at the longest distance along the "
"potential curve. If the longest distance is less than 10 Å, then D\\ "
":math:`_{\\rm e}` and D\\ :math:`_0` are not computed, and instead a value "
"of 0 is printed."
msgstr ""
"D\\ :math:`_{\\rm e}` 和 D\\ :math:`_0` "
"是根据拟合最小距离处的能量以及沿势能曲线最长距离处的能量计算得出的。如果最长距离小于 10 Å，则不会计算 D\\ :math:`_{\\rm e}` "
"和 D\\ :math:`_0`\\ ，而是打印出值 0。"

msgid "``TABLE,var1,var2,…``"
msgstr "``TABLE,var1,var2,…``"

msgid ""
"The appearance of the table may be modified using the following commands, "
"which may be given (in any order) directly after the the ``TABLE`` card:"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令修改表格的外观，这些命令可以（以任意顺序）直接放在\\ ``TABLE``\\ 卡片之后："

msgid ""
"**``HEADING,``\\ *head1, head2,…*** Specify a heading for each column. By "
"default, the names of the variables are used as headings."
msgstr "**``HEADING,``\\ *\\ head1, head2,…*** 为每一列指定标题。默认情况下，使用变量名作为标题。"

msgid ""
"**``FORMAT,``\\ *format*** Specify a format for each row in fortran style. "
"*format* must be enclosed by round brackets. Normally, the program "
"determines automatically an appropriate format, which depends on the type "
"and size of the printed data."
msgstr ""
"**``FORMAT,``\\ *\\ format*** 以 Fortran 风格为每一行指定格式。*\\ format* "
"必须用圆括号括起来。通常，程序会自动确定合适的格式，这取决于所打印数据的类型和大小。"

msgid ""
"**``FTYP``,\\ *typ1, typ2, typ3, …*** Simplified form to modify the format. "
"This gives the type (``A, F``, or ``D``) for each column (sensible defaults "
"are normally used)."
msgstr ""
"**``FTYP``,\\ *\\ typ1, typ2, typ3, …*** 修改格式的简化形式。为每一列给出类型（\\ ``A, F``\\ "
"或\\ ``D``\\ ）（通常使用合理的默认值）。"

msgid ""
"**``DIGITS``,\\ *dig1, dig2, dig3, …*** Give the number of digits after the "
"decimal points to be printed for each column (sensible defaults are normally"
" used)."
msgstr "**``DIGITS``,\\ *\\ dig1, dig2, dig3, …*** 给出每一列要打印的小数点后的位数（通常使用合理的默认值）。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVE``,\\ *file,status*** Specify a file on which the table will be "
"written. If *status* is ``NEW``, the file is rewound, otherwise it is "
"appended. In the case of Python format, unless *status* is ``NEW``, any "
"edits that have been made to a pre-existing file will be preserved, and only"
" the table data will be replaced. If *file* has a suffix that is one of "
"``txt, csv, tex, m, mpl, py, html, xml``, and a ``TYPE`` command is not "
"specified, then the type will be set to that which is conventionally "
"appropriate for the suffix. If *file* is omitted, then a file name is "
"automatically generated, with the form *input*.\\ ``table``\\ :math:`n`.\\ "
"*ext*: *input* is the basename of the input file (or ``molpro`` if running "
"from standard input); :math:`n` is a sequence number that is incremented by "
"one each time a table is produced; *ext* is a suffix appropriate to the file"
" format, eg ``txt``, ``html``, etc."
msgstr ""
"**``SAVE``,\\ *\\ file,status*** 指定将表格写入的文件。如果 *\\ status\\ * 为 "
"``NEW``，则文件被回绕（rewind），否则为追加。在 Python 格式的情况下，除非 *\\ status\\ * 为 "
"``NEW``，否则对已存在文件所做的任何编辑都将保留，仅替换表格数据。如果 *\\ file\\ * 具有后缀 ``txt, csv, tex, m,"
" mpl, py, html, xml`` 之一，且未指定 ``TYPE`` 命令，则类型将被设置为该后缀惯常对应的类型。如果省略 *\\ file\\"
" *，则自动生成文件名，形式为 *\\ input\\ *.\\ ``table``\\ :math:`n`.\\ *\\ ext\\ *：*\\ "
"input\\ * 是输入文件的基名（如果从标准输入运行则为 ``molpro``）；:math:`n` 是序列号，每次生成表格时递增一；*\\ "
"ext* 是适合文件格式的后缀，例如 ``txt``\\ 、\\ ``html`` 等。"

msgid ""
"**``TITLE,``\\ *title*** Specify one line of a title (several ``TITLE`` "
"cards may follow each other). Note that titles are only displayed in the "
"``SAVE`` file, if the ``SAVE`` command is given before the ``TITLE`` card."
msgstr ""
"**``TITLE,``\\ *\\ title*** 指定标题的一行（多个 ``TITLE`` 卡片可以依次出现）。注意，只有在 ``TITLE`` "
"卡片之前给出 ``SAVE`` 命令时，标题才会显示在 ``SAVE`` 文件中。"

msgid ""
"**``SORT,``\\ *col1,col2,…*** Sort rows according to increasing values of "
"the given columns. The columns are sorted in the order they are specified."
msgstr "**``SORT,``\\ *\\ col1,col2,…*** 按照给定列值的递增顺序对行进行排序。各列按指定的顺序排序。"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT,``\\ *key1,key2,…*** Specify print options (``TABLE, HEADING, "
"TITLE, WARNING, FORMAT, SORT``). The default is print for the first three, "
"and noprint for the last three."
msgstr ""
"**``PRINT,``\\ *\\ key1,key2,…*** 指定打印选项（\\ ``TABLE, HEADING, TITLE, "
"WARNING, FORMAT, SORT``\\ ）。默认情况下前三项打印，后三项不打印。"

msgid "**``NOPRINT,``\\ *key1,key2,…*** Disable print for given keys."
msgstr "**``NOPRINT,``\\ *\\ key1,key2,…*** 对给定的键禁用打印。"

msgid ""
"**``RANGE,``\\ *start,end*** Specify start and end indices of the variables "
"to be printed."
msgstr "**``RANGE,``\\ *\\ start,end*** 指定要打印的变量的起始和结束索引。"

msgid ""
"``STATISTICS`` Print also linear regression, upper and lower bounding lines,"
" and quadratic fits of the data columns. The slopes and intercepts of these "
"lines are saved in the Molpro variables"
msgstr "``STATISTICS`` 同时打印线性回归、上界和下界直线以及数据列的二次拟合。这些直线的斜率和截距保存在 Molpro 变量中"

msgid ""
"``REGRESSION_SLOPE, REGRESSION_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``LOWERBOUNDMIN_SLOPE, "
"LOWERBOUNDMIN_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``UPPERBOUNDMIN_SLOPE, "
"UPPERBOUNDMIN_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``LOWERBOUNDMAX_SLOPE, "
"LOWERBOUNDMAX_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``UPPERBOUNDMAX_SLOPE, "
"UPPERBOUNDMAX_INTERCEPT.``"
msgstr ""
"``REGRESSION_SLOPE, REGRESSION_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``LOWERBOUNDMIN_SLOPE, "
"LOWERBOUNDMIN_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``UPPERBOUNDMIN_SLOPE, "
"UPPERBOUNDMIN_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``LOWERBOUNDMAX_SLOPE, "
"LOWERBOUNDMAX_INTERCEPT,\\\\`` ``UPPERBOUNDMAX_SLOPE, "
"UPPERBOUNDMAX_INTERCEPT.``"

msgid "``[PLOT[,col1,col2,$\\dots$][,options]``"
msgstr "``[PLOT[,col1,col2,$\\dots$][,options]``"

msgid ""
"**``CMD=``\\ *unix_plot_command*** *unix_plot_command* consists of the "
"system command needed to start the plotting program, followed by any "
"required options. The whole thing should normally be enclosed in quotation "
"marks to preserve lower-case letters. The default is ``’xmgrace’``. At "
"present, the `//Grace// <http://plasma-gate.weizmann.ac.il/Grace>`__ program"
" (also known as *xmgrace, grace, gracebat*), with only numerical data, is "
"supported. The output is also compatible with the portable drop-in "
"replacement for Grace, `//AptPlot// <http://www.aptplot.com/>`__, and if "
"*Grace* is not found on the system, Molpro will attempt to use *AptPlot* as "
"default instead."
msgstr ""
"**``CMD=``\\ *\\ unix_plot_command*** *\\ unix_plot_command\\ * "
"由启动绘图程序所需的系统命令组成，后跟任何所需的选项。整个内容通常应括在引号中，以保留小写字母。默认为 ``’xmgrace’``。目前仅支持 "
"`//Grace// <http://plasma-gate.weizmann.ac.il/Grace>`__ 程序（也称为 *\\ "
"xmgrace、grace、gracebat\\ *），且仅支持数值数据。输出也兼容 Grace 的可移植替代品 `//AptPlot// "
"<http://www.aptplot.com/>`__，如果系统中找不到 *\\ Grace\\ *，Molpro 将尝试默认使用 *\\ "
"AptPlot*。"

msgid ""
"**``FILE=``\\ *plotfile*** By default the input file for the plotting "
"program is saved in *input*.\\ ``table``\\ :math:`n`.\\ ``plot``\\ "
":math:`m`.\\ ``agr``, where :math:`m` is an automatically generated sequence"
" number. The name of the plotfile can be modified using the ``FILE`` option."
msgstr ""
"**``FILE=``\\ *\\ plotfile*** 默认情况下，绘图程序的输入文件保存在 *\\ input*.\\ ``table``\\ "
":math:`n`.\\ ``plot``\\ :math:`m`.\\ ``agr`` 中，其中 :math:`m` 是自动生成的序列号。可以使用 "
"``FILE`` 选项修改绘图文件名。"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE=``\\ *type*** If ``TYPE`` is specified, *type* should be set to one"
" of ``pdf``, ``svg``, ``png``, ``jpeg`` or ``eps``. The result is that the "
"``gracebat`` program is executed on the plot input file to generate the "
"graph output file in the desired format. This feature depends on the "
"availability of ``gracebat``, and on it supporting the requested output "
"format (for example, at present pdf is supported under Mac OS X, but not in "
"some Linux systems)."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE=``\\ *\\ type*** 如果指定了 ``TYPE``，*\\ type* 应设置为 ``pdf``\\ 、\\ "
"``svg``\\ 、\\ ``png``\\ 、\\ ``jpeg`` 或 ``eps`` 之一。结果是将在绘图输入文件上执行 "
"``gracebat`` 程序，以生成所需格式的图形输出文件。此功能取决于 ``gracebat`` "
"的可用性，以及它是否支持所请求的输出格式（例如，目前在 Mac OS X 下支持 pdf，但在某些 Linux 系统下不支持）。"

msgid ""
"**``BACKGROUND=``\\ *rgb*** *rgb* should be a string of six hexadecimal "
"digits specifying the red-green-blue colour to use for the background of the"
" plot."
msgstr "**``BACKGROUND=``\\ *\\ rgb*** *\\ rgb* 应为一个六位十六进制数字字符串，指定用于绘图背景的红-绿-蓝颜色。"

msgid ""
"**``CURVE=``\\ *type*** Specifies type of curve to be drawn with points. "
"Possibilities are ``SPLINE`` (default; spline interpolation); ``NONE`` "
"(equivalent to ``NOSPLINE``); ``REGRESSION`` (linear regression line); "
"``UPPERBOUNDMAX`` (maximum gradient line that bounds points from above); "
"``UPPERBOUNDMIN`` (minimum gradient line that bounds points from above); "
"``LOWERBOUNDMAX`` (maximum gradient line that bounds points from below); "
"``LOWERBOUNDMIN`` (minimum gradient line that bounds points from below)."
msgstr ""
"**``CURVE=``\\ *\\ type*** 指定用点绘制的曲线类型。可选值为 ``SPLINE``\\ （默认；样条插值）；\\ "
"``NONE``\\ （等同于 ``NOSPLINE``\\ ）；\\ ``REGRESSION``\\ （线性回归直线）；\\ "
"``UPPERBOUNDMAX``\\ （从上方界定点的最大梯度直线）；\\ ``UPPERBOUNDMIN``\\ "
"（从上方界定点的最小梯度直线）；\\ ``LOWERBOUNDMAX``\\ （从下方界定点的最大梯度直线）；\\ "
"``LOWERBOUNDMIN``\\ （从下方界定点的最小梯度直线）。"

msgid "**``NSPLINE=``\\ *number*** Number of interpolation points (default 20)"
msgstr "**``NSPLINE=``\\ *\\ number*** 插值点的数量（默认 20）"

msgid ""
"**``LEGEND=’``\\ *x, y*\\ ``’``** Position legend at :math:`(x,y)` on plot."
msgstr "**``LEGEND=’``\\ *\\ x, y\\ *\\ ``’``** 将图例放置在绘图上的 :math:`(x,y)` 处。"

msgid ""
"``LEGEND=OFF`` Do not draw legend; this behaviour is chosen automatically "
"when there is only a single ordinate dataset."
msgstr "``LEGEND=OFF`` 不绘制图例；当只有一个纵坐标数据集时，会自动选择此行为。"

msgid ""
"**``PCOMMAND=’``\\ *command*\\ ``’``** Insert arbitrary *Grace* command into"
" the plot file; for details, consult http://plasma-"
"gate.weizmann.ac.il/Grace/doc/UsersGuide.html#s5."
msgstr ""
"**``PCOMMAND=’``\\ *\\ command\\ *\\ ``’``** 将任意 *\\ Grace* 命令插入绘图文件；详情请参阅 "
"http://plasma-gate.weizmann.ac.il/Grace/doc/UsersGuide.html#s5。"

msgid ""
"**``COLOUR``,\\ *icolour1, icolour2,...*** Colour map to be used for columns"
" 1,2,...; zero means to use default values (colours black, blue, red, green "
"cycle)"
msgstr ""
"**``COLOUR``,\\ *\\ icolour1, icolour2,...*** 用于第 1、2、... "
"列的颜色映射；零表示使用默认值（颜色依次循环为黑色、蓝色、红色、绿色）"

msgid ""
"**``COLOUR``,\\ *rgb1, rgb2,...*** Absolute colours (6-hex-digit rgb values)"
" to be used for columns 1,2,...;"
msgstr "**``COLOUR``,\\ *\\ rgb1, rgb2,...*** 用于第 1、2、... 列的绝对颜色（六位十六进制 rgb 值）；"

msgid ""
"**``SYMBOL``,\\ *isymb1, isymb2,...*** Symbol types to be used for columns "
"1,2,...; -1 means no symbols; zero means to use default values."
msgstr ""
"**``SYMBOL``,\\ *\\ isymb1, isymb2,...*** 用于第 1、2、... 列的符号类型；-1 "
"表示无符号；零表示使用默认值。"

msgid ""
"**``LINEWIDTH``,\\ *width1, width2,...*** Line widths to be used for columns"
" 1,2,...; omit to use default values."
msgstr "**``LINEWIDTH``,\\ *\\ width1, width2,...*** 用于第 1、2、... 列的线宽；省略则使用默认值。"

msgid ""
"**``LINESTYLE``,\\ *style1, style2,...*** Line styles to be used for columns"
" 1,2,...; omit to use default values."
msgstr "**``LINESTYLE``,\\ *\\ style1, style2,...*** 用于第 1、2、... 列的线型；省略则使用默认值。"

msgid "``DIATOMIC[,DEGREE=n][,MASS=m][,PRINT=p]``"
msgstr "``DIATOMIC[,DEGREE=n][,MASS=m][,PRINT=p]``"
